%% §21 machine 6 of 8 — Campaign  (Prisma enum: CampaignState)
%% §21: DRAFT -> STAFFING -> APPROVAL -> ACTIVE -> REPORTING -> COMPLETED / CANCELLED
    direction TB
    [*] --> DRAFT : created from an approved brief
    DRAFT --> STAFFING : matching and invitations go out
    STAFFING --> APPROVAL : roster agreed with the sponsor
    APPROVAL --> STAFFING : sponsor wants a different roster (derived)
    APPROVAL --> ACTIVE : orders accepted, work begins
    ACTIVE --> REPORTING : delivery finished, results being compiled
    REPORTING --> COMPLETED : sponsor report delivered
    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : cancelled in flight
    STAFFING --> CANCELLED : cancelled before it started
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of REPORTING
      The sponsor report is the document that earns
      the renewal — REPORTING is a real working state,
      not a formality.
    end note
